0 & 0 & 0 & 1 
\end{pmatrix},$$
the associated Alexander polynomial is $\Delta_{\tilde A(3,1)}(t) =\det(t U - U^T) = t^4 + t^3 + t + 1$.
\item  $(\tilde A(2, 2), \sigma_{2,2})$: One unipotent companion is
