The final 354-vertex oracle eventually solved, so that rung did not harden. The harness is now on its last allowed round: 472 vertices and 40-bit multiplicities. If any model solves here, the formal outcome will be `budget_bound` because `escalate()` still has fixed-witness room—meaning park, not reject.
